ation); agent stops without a spec", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "All phase 1-3 skills carry disable-model-invocation: true, so the agent never runs them; if work arrives without a spec or tickets the agent stops and asks.", "source_file": "docs/workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_workflow_one_skill_per_phase", "label": "One canonical skill per phase", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "grill-with-docs = grilling + domain-modeling + doc creation; SDD gives one fresh implementer per task plus a spec-compliance + quality review loop; implement-spec breaks one-PR-per-ticket and the no-parallel-writers rule; writing-plans examples are TypeScript-specific so Moodle's plan gates live in plans/README.md; requesting-code-review is the reviewer SDD already uses.", "source_file": "docs/workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_workflow_rejected_skill_alternatives", "label": "Non-phase skill alternatives (grilling, grill-me, writing-implementation-plans, implement-spec, executing-plans, tdd, code-review)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_workflow_spec_lifecycle", "label": "Spec lifecycle draft -> approved -> on main -> implemented", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Specs are never deleted - portfolio evidence.", "source_file": "docs/workflow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_workflow_plan_lifecycle", "label": "Plan lifecycle ready -> in-progress -> done; first commit of PR", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Committed as the first commit of the ticket's PR so the PR reads spec -> plan -> code; never deleted.", "source_file": "docs/workflow.md",